<title>CHINA: China corn exports at 530,000 tonnes in Jan-April.</title>
<headline>China corn exports at 530,000 tonnes in Jan-April.</headline>
<dateline>BEIJING 1997-05-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>China exported 530,000 tonnes of corn in the first four months of this year compared with virtually no exports in the year-ago period, the customs figures showed on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Exports in April alone reached 290,000 tonnes, it said.</p>
<p>China halted corn exports in late 1994 amid soaring domestic prices.</p>
<p>China had no imports of corn for January to April compared with 400,000 tonnes of imports in the year-ago period, the customs figures showed. --Beijing Newsroom (8610) 6532 1921</p>
</text>
